<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Salomon starts Intevac.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Salomon starts Intevac.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it initiated coverage of Intevac Inc with a buy rating, setting a six-to-12-month price target range of $20-$22 on the stock.</p>
<p>-- The shares were off 1/2 at 15-1/2.</p>
</text>
